# Bot1 casts Song of Totentanz with X = 1 and, with it on the stack, flashes in Lutri, the Spellchaser, whose enters trigger copies
# it (CR 707.10). The copy keeps X = 1 (CR 707.2): it makes a Rat, and the original makes a second, so two Rats in all. Both
# resolutions give haste to the creatures Bot1 controls as each resolves: Lutri, summoning sick, and the Rats.

[Bot1 Deck]
